      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree ac8b723db921c14b9d25456d1822379be1005cb7\nparent 649bc0a645eb127a9b1e6d078f8d129be6380c87\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792038995 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792041008 +0200\n\npolicy: sum package weight in int64_t\n\nstd::accumulate keeps its running total in the type of its initial\nvalue. IsWellFormedPackage passed a plain 0, so the package weight was\nsummed in an int, even though the lambda and the result are int64_t.\nA package heavier than INT_MAX would wrap and could pass the\nMAX_PACKAGE_WEIGHT check. No such package reaches this check today:\nRPC request bodies and P2P messages are far smaller.\n\nStart the sum from int64_t{0}, as the vsize sum in validation.cpp\nalready does.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEsRUSBAxuhte14D3RTXHtOpqO38UFAmrQYDAbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEE1x7Tqajt/FiqcP/1NqG8C6VMz6iMgMO/i3\n/mp4BHSfSnm0TnZ78hnL6ayK3bnodLOPiXF+btvVrjY4Xlw4unoXIIGv8tJfGwEj\nx88U4v0LMI0kVD5hVVKHfrXKf/GcAnIiB1yYyCNZt5IJT/FksLcoz05xR8o9ZEj3\nJWWvVERkdZj5ZWHGDiwc+v4A2tB8jCEQZwE6Xwx0RbGQXJ3+ThoeBd/Lrh4D0JsF\nUVOzd60ULduB70YVr2QhxTeoSlduyGRfKJxNvFB/OdxqBaouTSiLHCJdA/an0v3R\n3GwfDMwGhq0AXRofadkQZrWbwz6FRDK3VbQT3weRcXNarisSVRg8qaH17a+73pT/\nnJXQtN9/RVexMxejvNVcFWJKyHa9tqsjW0XZ2CpEWDgZI18+RllWfT75Fd8NT7eB\nYjwQ2fUpNkgvmo9Hn8uYWv7v2sZHLz9SPnlqNl1r46w9q8LKni2+JugNt/pWWAeO\nL2/CFAYnJfWM11LkmTBF6TAJrWNR4ykOLincn1dhQsCIOWLsGBoMbNvt/g64wyRm\n2mZbHU0ixeDFzKsGTYCQleO+AXO9ipKmH81CrehyPGvXggBUAFwwYxaDCTgorNqs\nS2B3asxXJ2KhNTl0uKqNpvuAA9kVAopeI7P3VCoNgSzLtgtmY8Jy+ynba9/UZAI8\nlYF1yGdV3+K3/+/qVow7u8CD\n=4mwX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
