      ],
      "message": "policy: sum package weight in int64_t\n\nstd::accumulate keeps its running total in the type of its initial\nvalue. IsWellFormedPackage passed a plain 0, so the package weight was\nsummed in an int, even though the lambda and the result are int64_t.\nA package heavier than INT_MAX would wrap and could pass the\nMAX_PACKAGE_WEIGHT check. No such package reaches this check today:\nRPC request bodies and P2P messages are far smaller.\n\nStart the sum from int64_t{0}, as the vsize sum in validation.cpp\nalready does.",
